# Planning docs quote the private bundle (calibration/performance judgments
# about named colleagues). This repo is public — never publish them.
.planning/

docs/convergence-analysis-*.md

# Claude Code local state. Deliberately NOT a blanket `.claude/`: settings.json
# and commands/ are worth shipping to contributors, and a blanket ignore would
# swallow them later without a word.
# worktrees/ is a git checkout — committing one nests a repo inside the repo.
# settings.local.json holds per-machine permissions and is written without
# being asked for, so it has to be ignored before it appears, not after.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json

# PR body scratch (untracked)
.pr-body.md
